      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Form leads into GetSales\n\n1. Create a **GetSales API** credential with a key from GetSales, Settings, API keys (the Automation platform preset).\n2. Pick the table in **Add to a table** and a published GetSales workflow in **Add to a GetSales workflow**.\n3. Share the form's production URL.\n\nA person GetSales already has comes back as it is, and the workflow leaves anyone it holds already alone, so a repeated submission starts nothing twice. Your stoplist still applies.",
